{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who said the job of a courier is easy? In the world of <strong>Delivery Up Together</strong>, even gravity tries to stop you. Your route goes through challenging and unique sections\u2014from steep mountain slopes to unstable constructions in the sky. Every 1000 m you\u2019re greeted by a hungry NPC client: deliver the food, save at the checkpoint, and climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The main rule</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The backpack is your life. Touch any surface with it twice\u2014and it will fall off; you\u2019ll have to climb back down, otherwise the path to the next level will be blocked. Decide whether to take the risk and push forward, or return for your precious cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch to the moped</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need speed? Switch to your moped at any moment to quickly pass dangerous sections. But be careful: controlling a vehicle in the air is even harder than on foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical challenge</strong>: a game for those who love Only Up\u2013style trials\u2014constant upward movement where every mistake sends you back. Jump, climb, and balance through a 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backpack mechanic</strong>: two hits\u2014and the order flies down. You\u2019ll need to go retrieve it, otherwise the delivery won\u2019t happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b48b50e240471a5b9dc0b6b9dbba.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b48b50e240471a5b9dc0b6b9dbba.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b48b50e240471a5b9dc0b6b9dbba.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive gameplay</strong>: moving platforms, traps, rotating objects, physics-based elements, and even labyrinths you'll have to overcome on your way up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fe9a9555d21367fc64c8a063a429b180.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fe9a9555d21367fc64c8a063a429b180.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fe9a9555d21367fc64c8a063a429b180.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moped</strong>: instantly switch to your vehicle for quick maneuvers or long jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/9a118a842bbaac0cff6aeaf5f540046b.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/9a118a842bbaac0cff6aeaf5f540046b.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/9a118a842bbaac0cff6aeaf5f540046b.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkpoint clients</strong>: hand the food to NPCs and save your progress to restart from a new level after a fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/75b2db879eb5df84a8c73c290da9ff5e.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/75b2db879eb5df84a8c73c290da9ff5e.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/75b2db879eb5df84a8c73c290da9ff5e.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time capsules</strong>: collect special capsules to rewind time and fix mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/f349be9442469270323d8982d01986da.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/f349be9442469270323d8982d01986da.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/f349be9442469270323d8982d01986da.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op for up to 4 players</strong>: play with friends and compete to see who reaches the finish first. You can progress carefully side by side or create chaos by pushing each other off the route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fbbfdbd0b95c9a2f837dbc444a605b5a.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fbbfdbd0b95c9a2f837dbc444a605b5a.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/fbbfdbd0b95c9a2f837dbc444a605b5a.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character switching</strong>: choose the courier that suits you best and change your appearance anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/cb8dffdd58128890354712d06e6e0f75.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/cb8dffdd58128890354712d06e6e0f75.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/cb8dffdd58128890354712d06e6e0f75.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your playstyle</strong>: from trainee mode with frequent saves and unlimited time capsules to \u201cexpress delivery\u201d with no room for mistakes. Suitable both for casual runs and speedruns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for heights where every meter has a price, and every order has its destiny. Take on the challenge of <strong>Delivery Up Together</strong> and prove that the best way to a client's heart lies through the clouds!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Delivery Peak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/f1752f70eab327e370f1ece8596163c6cccf2170.jpg"},{"name":"First Height","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/4ba229a123ca29dc414433d8cbf461d2f90659db.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/c43e8595d014ba5f83abe3a2d43d07dc514b70c4.jpg"},{"name":"To the Skies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/26d654f9ddcb58f724146409f09b0dac2a2a9e35.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch, That Hurt!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/8d9133f66e5bfd87759f9ade9af30389239d964c.jpg"},{"name":"Gravity Isn\u2019t Joking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/d513a413e3fce0ae12fe75146ddcbd999c0c46ab.jpg"},{"name":"Back for the Bag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/11e4bccb5a2c72e27072078a5f42979ae9a7e18b.jpg"},{"name":"Forgetful Courier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/6c1cdaccad3aac03e0642792c90597a2397709f6.jpg"},{"name":"On Wheels","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/a1ded57ee9ee497748e9fea1a52c2047bb9d7961.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless Climb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817600/350e3407070516f1d8d1c1b50adfcf96f81207fa.jpg"}],"total":13},"backgr