\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch to the moped</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need speed? Switch to your moped at any moment to quickly pass dangerous sections. But be careful: controlling a vehicle in the air is even harder than on foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical challenge</strong>: a game for those who love Only Up\u2013style trials\u2014constant upward movement where every mistake sends you back. Jump, climb, and balance through a 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6099ca6a7cb17a0030bea6630562c985.mp4?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backpack mechanic</strong>: two hits\u2014and the order flies down. You\u2019ll need to go retrieve it, otherwise the delivery won\u2019t happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b48b50e240471a5b9dc0b6b9dbba.poster.avif?t=1763412140\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b48b50e240471a5b9dc0b6b9dbba.webm?t=1763412140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817600/extras/6632b4